window.products.push({"id":120215,"name":"W10921514 Cold Water Inlet Valve with W10921515 Hot Water Inlet Valve by Beaquicy- Replacement for Ken-more Whirlpool Washer- Replaces W10240949 & W10","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wYxPNozPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ 𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀-𝑺𝑼𝑷𝑷𝑶𝑹𝑻𝑺 𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑹𝑬𝑻𝑼𝑹𝑵 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝑬𝑿𝑪𝑯𝑨𝑵𝑮𝑬.Beaquicy attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. 【𝑮𝑶𝑶𝑫 𝑪𝑯𝑶𝑰𝑪𝑬】---The package includes 1 x W10921515 water inlet valve , 1 x W10921514 water inlet valve.W10921514 inlet valve has two valves, W10921515 inlet valve has one valve.The cold water inlet valve W10921514 and hot water inlet valve W10921515 is for washing machine. The W10921514 W10921515 water inlet valves are used to control the water level of cold and hot water and equalize the water temperature of the washing machine, control the cold and hot water flow into the washer. 【𝑾𝑰𝑫𝑬 𝑪𝑶𝑴𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑩𝑰𝑳𝑬】---The Cold Water Inlet Valve W10921514 and Hot Water Inlet Valve W10921515 can replacement for Ken-more, May-tag, Whirl-pool washer.▶𝘞10921514 𝘙𝘦𝘱𝘭𝘢𝘤𝘦𝘴 𝘕𝘶𝘮𝘣𝘦𝘳𝘴:𝘗𝘋00038781,𝘞11168740,𝘞10240949,4546379,𝘈𝘗6285450,33390069.▶𝘞10921515 𝘙𝘦𝘱𝘭𝘢𝘤𝘦𝘴 𝘕𝘶𝘮𝘣𝘦𝘳𝘴: 𝘗𝘋00040928,𝘞11168743,𝘞11168743,𝘞11168743,𝘞10240948,4585634,𝘈𝘗6327638,33390068.✦FIT MODELS:11026002010 11026002011 11026002012 7MMVWX500YW0 7MMVWX500YW1 MVWX550XW2 MVWX5SPAW0 WTW5500XW0 WTW5500XW1.𝑴𝒐𝒓𝒆 𝒄𝒐𝒎𝒑𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒃𝒍𝒆 𝒎𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔 𝒂𝒓𝒆 𝒍𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒆𝒅 𝒊𝒏 𝒅𝒆𝒔𝒄𝒓𝒊𝒑𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏. 【𝑷𝑹𝑬𝑴𝑰𝑼𝑴 𝑴𝑨𝑻𝑬𝑹𝑰𝑨𝑳】---W10921514 Washer Water Inlet Valve and W10921515 Washer Water Inlet Valve are made of high quality ABS and metal materials for excellent durability, through the manufacturer's strict inspection, conform to OEM standard, ensure long-term effective operation. If the washing machine will have the following conditions, please the water inlet valve need to be replaced in time: ★continuous water intake; ★Inlet valve thread damaged; ★The water inlet valve are leaking. 【𝑬𝑨𝑺𝒀 𝑻𝑶 𝑰𝑵𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑳𝑳】---The installation of W10921514 washer cold water inlet valve and W10921515 washer hot water inlet valve are simple. You should prepare the helpful tools include: a screwdriver, a pair of work gloves. Unplug and turn off the power and water supply to the washer before making any repairs. Following along with an online repair video is the easiest way to ensure proper DIY installation. A simple installation can save you a lot on replacing your washer or hiring a mechanic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wYxPNozPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08BFS737D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-120215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BFS737D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BFS737D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
