window.products.push({"id":120301,"name":"WAFIET 30 Inch Gas Cooktop with TIMER Dual Fuel 5 Italy SABAF Sealed Burners Gas Stove Top NG/LPG Convertible Gas Hob with Thermocouple Protection - E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zs6akneQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥【RELIABLY STABLE PERFORMANCE BURNERS】 concealed SABAF burners maintain delivering fire blue flame all the time without gas leaking or wasting. made in Italy, all the burners are reliable with high quality for stable and efficient performance even after decades’ daily use. (Griddle Not Include ) 🔥【5 BURNERS FOR QUICK COOKING】 Wide range BTU power (3500BTU *1, 6000BTU*2, 10000BTU *2) offer wide ranges of cooking flame. The countertop stove meets all needs from chocolate melting and making sauces with simmering burner to water boiling with rapid boiling burner. Cooking at the same time enable a quick lunch or dinner preparing. 🔥【SAFE THERMOCOUPLE PROTECTION】 to ensure your safety in an emergency, built-in flam failure protection device will shutoff the gas automatically if a flame is not detected 🔥【LPG/NG CONVERTIBLE】 delivers the same BTU power range to propane and natural gas cooktops. Both Nozzles are Included in the package 🔥【ADDED TIMER ENSURING SAFE COOKING】 Make possible you cook delicate dishes with the gas cooktop. The timer offer remind with time period range from 1-60minuts. Just enjoy your cooking with less worry that you scorch your dishes 🔥【HEAVY DUTY MATERIAL】 0.65mm stainless steel gas stoves plate resist rust and scratches and is easy-to-clean. The gas range’s Moveable iron cast grates allows quick clean with a damp cloth to keep it new over years. Continuous cast-iron grates enable sliding a variety of heavy pots across burners support a griddle. Metal knobs resist hot melting and is easy to operate. 🔥【1-YEAR WARRANTY AND DROP-IN INSTALLATION】 standard cut-out dimension and professional parts and tools are offered for quick and safe installation. 24-month warranty provides a new set replacement. Please come to us anytime for any problem about this countertop burners for kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zs6akneQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAFIET","source_asin":"B09XDMNB1F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-120301","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XDMNB1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XDMNB1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
