window.products.push({"id":120629,"name":"SEISSO 8 Pack Refrigerator Air Filters Replacement, Carbon Activated Filter Compatible with Frigidaire Pure Air Ultra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719FzEwNMkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Includes: 8 PCS Refrigerator Air Filter Replacement. High Quality Material: The refrigerator air filter replacement is made of premium quality activated carbon, which can efficiently absorb odor from your refrigerator. Bring back the clean, fresh air to you. Compatible Filter Models: For air filters are compatible with EAFCBF, PAULTRA, SCPUREAIR2PK, RAF1150, 242047801, 242047804, 242047805, 242061001, 241754001, 241754002, 241754003, 241791601, 242017800, PS1993820, 7241754001, 241754004, SP-FRAIR. Easy to Use & Tips: Super easy to install in minutes without any tools. We recommend that replace filter every 6 months to keep the air fresh in the refrigerator. 24 hour customer service: If you have any questions about package or product, please feel free to contact us ,we are always ready to help you solve the problem at the first time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719FzEwNMkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEISSO","source_asin":"B08DFXZFDN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-120629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DFXZFDN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DFXZFDN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":120630,"name":"Waterdrop Plus 8171413 NSF 401&53&42 Certified Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for Whirlpool® 8171413, EDR8D1, Kenmore® 46-9002, NLCS200, Pack ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nFQurgdWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Waterdrop refrigerator filter can reduce 95.3% of 𝐏𝐅𝐎𝐀 and 𝐏𝐅𝐎𝐒 tested by the third-party laboratory Replacement for models: Whirlpool 8171413, EDR8D1, 8171414, 8171413R, 8171414R, 2204324, 2204326, WFI-NL200, WFI-NLC200, NL200, NLC200, WFI-NLCS200, NLCS200. Kenmore 9002, 09002P, 0469002, 046-9002, 9002P, 04609002000, 2206039, 2206048, 2213384, 2204324, RFC1400A , RWF1022, WF286, CLCH111, WSW-4, Waterdrop is an independent brand. [Authoritative Certifications] Dedicated to providing pure and healthy drinking water, Waterdrop, a world-famous water purification brand, has been trusted by over 6 million American families. Waterdrop's high-quality replacement filters, from every component to the whole filter, have been certified by NSF and IAPMO against NSF/ANSI 401, 53, 42 and 372 standards for effective reduction of 29 substances, ensuring high-quality drinking water. [Comprehensive Certifications] This filter has been strictly certified against NSF/ANSI 401 for reduction of 99.2% of bisphenol A, phenytoin, estrone, ibuprofen and naproxen and against NSF/ANSI 53 for reduction of 99.99% of cyst. It is certified by IAPMO for reduction of 20 harmful substances like 99.59% of ethylbenzene, over 99% of trimethoprim, 2,4 D, lindane, MTBE and atrazine. Furthermore, it can reduce PFOA and PFOS according to testing. [Deep filtration] Waterdrop's refrigerator filters significantly reduce the levels of many different harmful substances in your water. The filter additionally allows through many of the beneficial minerals in water that are essential for health. [Fast water flow, no leaks] Our mission is to supply refrigerator water filters that fit perfectly, impeccably engineered; this sets us apart from inferior models of replacement filters that can frequently result in water leakage problems. The microscopic pore sizes in our filter cartridges, made of superior materials, allow for smooth running, crisp, pure water. Waterdrop uses coconut shell carbon blocks supplied from Sri Lanka that have enlarged surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon blocks. The filter cartridge is far more effective in reducing levels of chlorine, dirt, sediment, rust, and a wide range of heavy metals tested by a third-party laboratory. In line with our high level of attention to detail, we have chosen a BPA-free and food-grade housing for the filter that exceeds the NSF 372 certification for lead-free filtration. [Regular filter changes] If you run replacement filter past the recommended date, something could accumulate and filtration performance could suffer. Because of this, we supply a complimentary set of installation stickers with every filter so that you can see at a glance when it needs replacing. We recommend that you should replace your filter after it has been used for 4800 cups of water (300 gallons) or 6 months (this may vary dependent on the water condition in your area). [Professional standards] Our expert teams pride themselves on not letting any product or part of a product, down to the smallest components, leave our factory unless we are satisfied that they have reached and exceeded the very highest market standards. Our dedication doesn't just apply within the factory: we have a customer service team ready to answer your questions and deal with any problems 24/7. [More than just a business] Waterdrop is passionate about providing clean water for as many people as possible with lower environmental impact. We use cowhide corrugated box packaging, reducing the wastage other companies create with their materials. A percentage of the purchase price from every one of our filters is used to fund projects providing clean, pure water for African children who don't have access to safe water supplies. [Purified with love] We believe everyone has the right to consume pure water, no matter where they are. We are not only about our business; we prioritize using our technology to help people. A portion of every purchase made is donated to deliver clean, pure water to children in water-scarce regions in Africa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nFQurgdWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B01CA0V1T6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-120630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CA0V1T6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CA0V1T6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
