window.products.push({"id":120698,"name":"Panda 110V 850W Electric Compact Portable Clothes Laundry Dryer with Stainless Steel Tub Apartment Size 1.5 cu.ft & COMFEE CLV09N1AMG Portable Washer,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":433.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iYVzLfLRL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Panda 110V Electric Portable Compact Laundry Clothes Dryer, 1.5 cu.ft, Stainless Steel Drum Black and White, PAN725SFThis compact dryer makes it easy to quickly dry clothes, sheets, table linens, and more, without taking up a lot of room - Perfect for apartments or other small living spaces, such as dorms, RVs. And it also can be the second dryer in your house. It perfectly coordinate with any Panda washers, and any other compact washing machines. Choose drying time, from 20 to 200 minutes. A wall-hanging bracket comes included, can be wall mounted. Regular 3 prongs 110 Voltage can be plugged anywhere, 850 Watts of motor rate which may take a little longer time to dry the clothes, but it saves the electricity bills.Brand: PandaModel: PAN725SFColor: White & BlackVoltage: 110V/60HzRated Input: 850WattsTumble Material: Stainless SteelDrying Program: Cool(0-20mins), Warm(20-120mins), Hot(120-200mins),Air Dry(0-80mins)Heat: Low, High (High is always recommended, which will give you the hightest tempreture setting) Automatic shut -off functionProduct Dimensions(W D H): 19.5 16 23.8 INCH / 49.5 41 60.5 CMProduct Weight: 37.5 LBS / 17KGPackage Dimensions(W D H): 20.9 17.1 26 INCH / 53 43.5 66 CMGross Weight: 41.9 LBS / 19KGPre-use Caution:1. It's ideal to mount on the wall. Wall mounting kit included. But you will have to mount a lumber on the wall first, then mount it on the lumber. 2. Comes with exhuasted venting pipe to vent to outside. 3. It is lightweight in 40lbs, you can easy move around and place it beside to window. 4. It is fine to leave it inside the room in the winter. It blows warm air with humidity. If you have the concerns of humidity, recommend to get an indoor venting kit which helps to collect the moisture.COMFEE' Portable Washing Machine, 0.9 cu.ft Compact Washer With LED Display, 5 Wash Cycles, 2 Built-in Rollers, Space Saving Full-Automatic Washer, Ideal Laundry for RV, Dorm, Apartment, Magnetic GrayFeeling unsafe going to Laundromat? Tired of sending and picking up clothes from public washer? Want to have your own laundry setup in your bathroom? Let this little machine do all the magic for you! It's small, space saving, and yet powerful to take care of your daily laundry needs.- Space saving, fits in your room/RV/dormetory nicely- High quality and durable motor, providing stable power- Stainless steel inner tub with multiple washing programs to choose from- See-through lid and LED display- Wheels to move aroud- Brand new washing machines come with a drain plug: don’t forget to remove it before you hook up the drain hose.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iYVzLfLRL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panda","source_asin":"B09NNHZ62L","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-120698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NNHZ62L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NNHZ62L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
