window.products.push({"id":120725,"name":"Nugget ice Maker Machine 40lbs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NwDU2uN4L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"BPA-free Water Filter Replacement: If you have been looking for a way to reduce harmful impurities from your drinking water, the solution is here. Pre-filter layer with natural coconut shell activated carbon and high-quality ion-exchange resin ensure maximum filtration. This replacement for Freezimer nugget ice maker effectively filters off impurities from your water. App Smart Control: Freezimer nugget ice makers countertop is equipped with remote control app. Just connect WiFi with your home network (only supports 2.4GHz Wifi), and you can remotely control the pellet ice maker on your smartphone when you are outside. Set up your ice making schedule (Set the ice making time in advance), ice making and self-cleaning functions from your phone by using the Smart Life app. 40 lbs Ice Daily Capacity: Countertop nugget ice maker makes the first batch of ice in 8 mins after pressing the ON/OFF button. Produces 40lbs crushed ice cubes per day, 2.8L water tank capacity, R600a environmentally friendly refrigerant that makes sure it is energy-saving and works efficiently. A perfect smart and sonic ice machine that you can use at home, office, or even restaurants. Self-Cleaning Function: This nugget ice maker machine is equipped with the self-cleaning system, just press the ON/OFF button and hold it for 3 seconds, the machine will start to auto-clean. When the cleaning is done, simply open the pump to drain the dirty water. It greatly facilitates your daily maintenance work. Infrared Sensor & Simple Panel: Freezimer 40lbs ice cube maker is equipped with advanced infrared sensor technology. Nugget ice maker will automatically stop making ice when the ice basket is full or when you need to add water, the indicator light will light up according to the corresponding situation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NwDU2uN4L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freezimer","source_asin":"B0BDFT8DZR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-120725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDFT8DZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDFT8DZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
